<i>and you couldn't wait.</i>

311
00:32:57.642 --> 00:32:58.893
No, Attorney Lee.

312
00:32:59.811 --> 00:33:03.064
Apparently, there was a misunderstanding.

313
00:33:03.147 --> 00:33:04.107
<i>Misunderstanding?</i>

314
00:33:05.149 --> 00:33:07.443
But that's your style, isn't it?

315
00:33:07.527 --> 00:33:11.155
<i>These are misunderstandings,</i>
<i>conflicts and incitement of enmity.</i>

316
00:33:11.239 --> 00:33:14.033
Maybe we'll meet in person?

317
00:33:14.117 --> 00:33:15.243
<i>Some other time.</i>

318
00:33:15.827 --> 00:33:16.953
<i>If he will still be.</i>

319
00:33:25.837 --> 00:33:27.422
grandfather

320
00:33:36.014 --> 00:33:39.267
