what i really want

380
00:38:32.893 --> 00:38:34.478
So I'll say it again.

381
00:38:35.813 --> 00:38:41.527
I want both Chuwon and Bonsan.

382
00:39:14.435 --> 00:39:16.187
<i>We will use Gu Jun Mo,</i>

383
00:39:17.480 --> 00:39:19.899
<i>to get rid of Nam Gi-seok.</i>

384
00:39:22.443 --> 00:39:24.028
<i>I will say it again.</i>

385
00:39:24.111 --> 00:39:28.908
